cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this case study or dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "PHP2Shell (CVE-2026-109618 / CVE-2026-109619): sourced, trilingual live case study and passive banner checker"
abstract: >-
  Sourced, defensive case study (PL/EN/DE) of the PHP2Shell vulnerabilities CVE-2026-109618 and
  CVE-2026-109619 in the PHP core, fixed in PHP 8.5.12, 8.4.27, 8.3.36 and 8.2.35 on 21 October 2026,
  with the live-center dataset (data/facts.json; every fact carries a source URL and confidence level)
  and a passive PHP banner checker. No exploit code.
authors:
